{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>由 Yak &amp; 開發的 Agent A – 偽裝遊戲，現於 Epic Games 開放 PC 限時免費，支援 Windows，截止時間為 10 月 22 日 23:00（香港時間）。本作結合間諜冒險、解謎與密室逃脫元素，玩家將以秘密代理身份追查神秘紅寶石與隱藏真相。</p>\n<p>遊戲以指向和點擊方式進行，玩家要在佈滿機關與線索的房間中探索，透過點選物件、蒐集與組合道具、解讀提示來破解謎題，並在隱藏物品與逃脫遊戲式關卡中找出出路。部分流程融入偽裝與諜戰氣氛，令推理、探索和解謎交錯推進。</p>\n<p>本作亦帶有獨立製作與謀殺遊戲式的懸疑感，強調房間探索和隱藏物品玩法。玩家可隨冒險逐步揭開代理任務與紅寶石背後的秘密；遊戲對應 Windows，經 Epic Games 領取後可在 PC 遊玩。</p>\n<img alt=\"【PC】諜戰偽裝密室解謎 Agent A 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Agent-Puzzle-In-Disguise-Gqv76.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】諜戰偽裝密室解謎 Agent A 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Agent-Puzzle-In-Disguise-Eyufc.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】諜戰偽裝密室解謎 Agent A 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Agent-Puzzle-In-Disguise-16obi.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】諜戰偽裝密室解謎 Agent A 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Agent-Puzzle-In-Disguise-1q098.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】諜戰偽裝密室解謎 Agent A 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Agent-Puzzle-In-Disguise-Ol099.jpg\">\n<p>遊戲名稱：Agent A – 偽裝遊戲<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：Epic Games</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T16:00:18.856567+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":384,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:39:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:57:39.766814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:57:44.505835+00:00","content_hash":"45e3cc7b22b22b30a8e639a807dfae9946adc2a195ab3f2621794a877febfba1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}